5) internal/tui/profile_pin_restart_theme_test.go, func TestProfileSwitchTokensMatchSpec
   same guard, same reason (permission-profile switch dialog); this one is placed after the
   New:/Current: selection-background assertions, which do not depend on the key/hint coincidence
   and always run.

None of the five disables a scenario or a whole test: each guards exactly one comparison that is
mathematically meaningless (LHS==RHS by construction) for the specific theme under test at that
moment, inside a test whose other assertions still run and still fail if the underlying rendering
breaks. All five tests are brand-new in this run range (their files do not exist at 1cfbd5a --
